Copy this file to  api-key-judgment.txt  and fill in the two values.
(api-key-judgment.txt is gitignored; this .example file is not.)

Both values go in double quotes on their own line. The labels are free text --
the loader identifies each value by its shape, not by the label above it:
anything starting with http is the URL, anything starting with sk- is the key.

URL:
"https://your-openai-compatible-endpoint.example"

api key:
"sk-your-key-here"
